      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "产品质量在线软测量业务问题",
          "html": "<p>化验滞后导致质量控制&quot;事后发现&quot;，不合格品只能回炼；在线分析仪表昂贵且维护量大。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 650 235\" role=\"img\"><title>产品质量在线软测量业务对象示意</title><rect x=\"245\" y=\"18\" width=\"105\" height=\"190\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"#e7f0e7\" stroke=\"#667c75\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M60 135H245M350 60H495M350 110H495M350 160H495M245 75H350M245 125H350\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#21796a\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"17\">原料与热量</text><text x=\"505\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"17\">轻组分</text><text x=\"505\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"17\">中组分</text><text x=\"505\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"17\">重组分</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"16\">过程观测 → 模型估计 → 化验与人工复核</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>产品质量在线软测量涉及的业务对象示意；图中关系不是现场工艺设计。窄屏可在图内滚动。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "闪点预测与连续软测量",
          "html": "<p>过程温度与流量连续记录，化验闪点按取样批次返回，两者时间尺度不同。AI 通过配对历史学习过程状态与闪点的关系，本例用归一化近邻回归估计闪点，并以校准残差给出经验范围。运行人员可把连续预测与后续化验对照，发现需要追加取样或重点观察的时段。</p><p>收益是填补两次化验之间的观察空档。运行人员可沿连续曲线查看闪点趋势，在预测变化快、经验范围变宽或与化验持续偏离的时段优先取样。演示同时给出预测误差与经验残差范围，交付中保留对齐量和近邻数，便于解释一次参数调整如何影响整个质量趋势。</p><p><b>默认对齐量为 3 个采样点，在后续 60 条评价记录上，训练均值基线 MAE 为 2.37℃，软测量 MAE 为 0.47℃，下降 80.4%。连续预测为两次化验之间提供质量变化线索。</b></p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"延迟对齐局部软测量默认合成计算图\"><title>延迟对齐局部软测量默认合成计算图</title><text x=\"82\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#355a4b\">闪点 / ℃</text><path d=\"M82 274H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"279\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">49.5</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">240</text><path d=\"M82 220.5H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"225.5\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">52.6</text><text x=\"241.5\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">255</text><path d=\"M82 167H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">55.6</text><text x=\"401\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">270</text><path d=\"M82 113.5H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"118.5\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">58.7</text><text x=\"560.5\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">284</text><path d=\"M82 60H720\" stroke=\"#dbe5dc\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#476457\">61.8</text><text x=\"720\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#476457\">299</text><path d=\"M82.00 197.79 L92.81 203.75 L103.63 227.09 L114.44 231.94 L125.25 236.93 L136.07 232.59 L146.88 229.08 L157.69 227.38 L168.51 227.18 L179.32 212.81 L190.14 211.63 L200.95 189.22 L211.76 173.37 L222.58 158.76 L233.39 143.73 L244.20 143.15 L255.02 145.40 L265.83 141.85 L276.64 146.29 L287.46 151.28 L298.27 152.19 L309.08 161.29 L319.90 194.44 L330.71 200.07 L341.53 213.89 L352.34 215.33 L363.15 216.85 L373.97 228.28 L384.78 234.90 L395.59 223.54 L406.41 220.42 L417.22 208.12 L428.03 184.99 L438.85 166.01 L449.66 139.42 L460.47 126.80 L471.29 101.89 L482.10 100.10 L492.92 95.85 L503.73 74.76 L514.54 79.93 L525.36 91.84 L536.17 98.64 L546.98 106.63 L557.80 124.26 L568.61 147.73 L579.42 155.07 L590.24 178.49 L601.05 205.50 L611.86 230.18 L622.68 239.29 L633.49 233.68 L644.31 243.03 L655.12 234.90 L665.93 223.23 L676.75 220.27 L687.56 206.16 L698.37 188.50 L709.19 179.34 L720.00 161.39\" stroke=\"#52667d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M82.00 191.70 L92.81 205.72 L103.63 211.31 L114.44 214.93 L125.25 216.70 L136.07 216.70 L146.88 220.75 L157.69 220.75 L168.51 223.76 L179.32 214.82 L190.14 205.64 L200.95 190.25 L211.76 183.45 L222.58 167.89 L233.39 157.01 L244.20 148.57 L255.02 145.86 L265.83 143.20 L276.64 143.20 L287.46 149.31 L298.27 151.62 L309.08 162.75 L319.90 183.92 L330.71 199.26 L341.53 214.07 L352.34 223.82 L363.15 225.22 L373.97 219.07 L384.78 217.84 L395.59 213.81 L406.41 211.94 L417.22 200.18 L428.03 178.93 L438.85 164.68 L449.66 140.76 L460.47 125.56 L471.29 117.00 L482.10 114.33 L492.92 111.59 L503.73 111.42 L514.54 109.91 L525.36 112.23 L536.17 111.29 L546.98 117.46 L557.80 125.15 L568.61 140.70 L579.42 165.33 L590.24 185.77 L601.05 207.99 L611.86 220.15 L622.68 231.59 L633.49 243.71 L644.31 245.67 L655.12 243.71 L665.93 227.99 L676.75 216.90 L687.56 207.19 L698.37 189.35 L709.19 168.73 L720.00 159.45\" stroke=\"#21796a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M82.00 178.13 L92.81 192.15 L103.63 197.74 L114.44 201.36 L125.25 203.13 L136.07 203.13 L146.88 207.18 L157.69 207.18 L168.51 210.19 L179.32 201.25 L190.14 192.07 L200.95 176.68 L211.76 169.88 L222.58 154.32 L233.39 143.44 L244.20 135.00 L255.02 132.29 L265.83 129.63 L276.64 129.63 L287.46 135.74 L298.27 138.05 L309.08 149.18 L319.90 170.35 L330.71 185.69 L341.53 200.50 L352.34 210.25 L363.15 211.65 L373.97 205.50 L384.78 204.27 L395.59 200.24 L406.41 198.37 L417.22 186.61 L428.03 165.36 L438.85 151.11 L449.66 127.19 L460.47 111.99 L471.29 103.43 L482.10 100.76 L492.92 98.02 L503.73 97.85 L514.54 96.35 L525.36 98.66 L536.17 97.72 L546.98 103.89 L557.80 111.58 L568.61 127.13 L579.42 151.76 L590.24 172.20 L601.05 194.42 L611.86 206.58 L622.68 218.02 L633.49 230.14 L644.31 232.10 L655.12 230.14 L665.93 214.42 L676.75 203.33 L687.56 193.62 L698.37 175.78 L709.19 155.16 L720.00 145.88\" stroke=\"#b96b38\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M82.00 205.27 L92.81 219.29 L103.63 224.88 L114.44 228.50 L125.25 230.27 L136.07 230.27 L146.88 234.32 L157.69 234.32 L168.51 237.33 L179.32 228.39 L190.14 219.21 L200.95 203.82 L211.76 197.02 L222.58 181.46 L233.39 170.58 L244.20 162.14 L255.02 159.43 L265.83 156.77 L276.64 156.77 L287.46 162.88 L298.27 165.19 L309.08 176.32 L319.90 197.49 L330.71 212.83 L341.53 227.64 L352.34 237.39 L363.15 238.79 L373.97 232.64 L384.78 231.41 L395.59 227.38 L406.41 225.51 L417.22 213.75 L428.03 192.50 L438.85 178.25 L449.66 154.33 L460.47 139.13 L471.29 130.57 L482.10 127.90 L492.92 125.16 L503.73 124.99 L514.54 123.48 L525.36 125.80 L536.17 124.86 L546.98 131.03 L557.80 138.72 L568.61 154.27 L579.42 178.90 L590.24 199.34 L601.05 221.56 L611.86 233.72 L622.68 245.16 L633.49 257.28 L644.31 259.24 L655.12 257.28 L665.93 241.56 L676.75 230.47 L687.56 220.76 L698.37 202.92 L709.19 182.30 L720.00 173.02\" stroke=\"#b96b38\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M82 50V274H720\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#789b8b\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"337\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#355a4b\">固定评价时间序号</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 2</b><span>默认教学参数的实际计算：合成化验闪点 / 局部软测量 / 探索区间上界 / 探索区间下界。评价闪点MAE 0.47℃；训练均值基线MAE 2.37℃；探索区间覆盖 81.67%。图示由同包model.js计算，交互演示可改变参数重算。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "过程序列与化验对齐",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">试点准备 300—500 组过程与化验配对资料，保留过程时间、取样时间、结果返回时间、温度、流量及闪点。建模时把化验值配回取样时刻，并按时间留出后续评价段。演示生成 308 个过程点，使用 180 条训练、60 条校准、60 条评价记录，化验标签延迟三点返回。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">过程变量</span><span class=\"cl-s\">温度、流量、压力</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">秒级</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">化验数据</span><span class=\"cl-s\">质量指标</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">每班 1—2 次</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">在线分析仪</span><span class=\"cl-s\">若已配置</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">作参考</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">人工复核记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">保留复核对象、原始证据与修订结论</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">过程序列、取样与化验时间、闪点值</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">样本版本与评价明细</span><span class=\"cl-s\">按原始对象分组，保留评价记录与版本</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">用于复查数值和追踪更新</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">专业资料与数据依据</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://www.eia.gov/energyexplained/oil-and-petroleum-products/refining-crude-oil-the-refining-process.php\">EIA：The refining process<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "标签时延与过程漂移",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span><span class=\"small muted\">化验延迟对齐与过程漂移决定预测质量</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><p>落地难度中，主要障碍是标签对错时间会让模型学到错误关系，原料和装置状态变化又会使旧样本失去代表性。试点应先核对取样时间和输送滞后，再按运行周期检查残差。保持时间顺序评价，持续收集新化验反馈，有助于及时发现需要更新模型或增加过程变量的阶段。</p><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">软测量<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">半监督回归<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">不确定度估计<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
